Node ID=01 Conversation Start, Sylvant
Text=Why does one such as you resist the calling of the dragon? You are a sylvant - one of the faerie. The strength of the hills and the elements is in your blood! Allow us to awaken the great scaled one and you shall know power!
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
