Node ID=01 Conversation Start, Demokin
Text=Why does one such as you resist the calling of the dragon? You are a demokin - surely you can feel the energy in this place, aching for release. Allow us to awaken the great scaled one and you shall know power!
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
