Node ID=10 temptation
Text=Power beyond belief! The dragon will allow us to crush our enemies utterly! Think - the Inquisition, at last, destroyed, and all those touched by magic allowed to walk freely in the world again. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And what world would be *left*? What scorched lands would we walk freely upon? No, I think it is time to end this - and you.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=How are you going to raise the dragon?
Go to node ID=30 ley lines

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why should I bargain with you? I think I will kill you, follow the assassin and take that relic for myself.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=Inquisitor IS
Reply Text=You have just offered the destruction of the Holy Office to a sworn officer of it. I will repeat that at your trial, if enough of you survives to have one.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=Wielder IS
Reply Text=You are offering me the one thing I have ever wanted, and you are offering it with a dragon. I have carried a spirit long enough to know what asks a price that size.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=Templar IS
Reply Text=My Order crossed a sea to keep a relic out of your hands, and you have just told me why. I am no longer curious about you.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=Saladin IS
Reply Text=You are promising to settle a quarrel I am not in. Saladin's men did not ride this far to watch a dragon arbitrate Europe.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Enough of this madness. Prepare to die.
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}
Icon=Fight Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 Combat
Text=Then your journey ends here, Lionheart. Your corpse will be the first meal for the dragon.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 ley lines
Text=The Ley lines that run through these hills were once alive with magical energy. Centuries ago, when the Disjunction occurred, the dragon stirred and stormed through this tomb. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=40 ley lines 2
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=40 ley lines 2
Text=Then your ancestor, Richard the Lionhearted, sealed the Disjunction, robbing the ley lines of their power and freezing the dragon in stone to this day. Ironically, Richard is buried in the next chamber. His spirit shall witness the dragon's rebirth and the rebirth of England... but under the rule of the Druids, not the monarchy.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then Richard won a double victory that day. I am here to make sure the dragon never awakens. 
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fighting the Druids Last Chamber
}

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=So what kind of power does the dragon offer?
